  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But then rebels came, enemies of beauty and the Moon, and they sabotaged these fonts, reducing the land to its... oof... natural state.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If we could restore it though, replenish the garden of old, the river may flow once more, and you could use it to reach your friend.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "These five fonts are said to have converted the Moon's light into lifeforce. Each corresponds to a stage of development.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This Font of Germination represents birth and, according to my studies, can be rejuvenated with a sufficient tribute of Seeds.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_019.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You'll need to travel all over Krokotopia, I suspect, to find enough. Me go? No, no, I couldn't do that. WHY? Well, that's a good question.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_020.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know I have the answer around this rickety old brain- oh, right! I'm rickety and old. I AM TOO old! In spirit. And in arteries.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_021.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So you go find the, what was it, SEEDS!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You found a Djinn? That's good! Teleported away? That's bad. But did you find the seeds?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_023.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KT-SE-GARD-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That's... wait, what is that? Not good, the other one. BAD! No, GREAT! Go place the seeds upon the Font of Germination.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Duck_LoonQuail_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/1.560_Dialogue/Quentin_Quail_KT-GARD_024.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1594437,
